      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَزْرٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of the trans. v. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَزَرَ</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And
app. used as a simple subst., having for its pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُزُورٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِزَرٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  [Also] A man <i>possessing little,</i>
